# invariant-lint allow-list (ratchet sidecar)
# One sanctioned finding-key per line. '#' starts a comment.
# A FAIL whose key is listed here is reported as ALLOWED and does NOT fail the
# run. Remove a line to re-arm that check. Re-seed today's reality deliberately
# with:  python invariant_lint.py <ROOT> --reseed
#
# Each entry should carry a one-line WHY in a preceding '#' comment so the next
# reader knows it is a sanctioned exception, not forgotten drift.
#
# This file ships EMPTY (header only). Seed your own workspace's exceptions
# deliberately: someone else's grandfathered violations are meaningless in
# your tree.
